Subject: [PATCH] nvgpu: Fix CERT-C violations

Fixed CERT-C INT30-C violations

Jira NVGPU-11950
Bug 6355239

Change-Id: I0417a8e08013e8b977cbca4d626fb4e4c68da741
Reviewed-on: https://git-master.nvidia.com/r/c/linux-nvgpu/+/3298707
(cherry picked from commit d19285cd4c72bf55e89a36bc733d5efe121d6d90)
Signed-off-by: atanand <atanand@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-on: https://git-master.nvidia.com/r/c/linux-nvgpu/+/3653406
Reviewed-by: Ankur Kishore <ankkishore@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-by: Sagar Kamble <skamble@nvidia.com>
